{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach visible object and inspect it. If not found, move randomly. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = InspectObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInSight    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />",
